  "reasoning": "The defendant, Yue, obtained large sums of construction progress payments by contracting projects and then refused to pay the workers, effectively deceiving the parties to obtain money for personal use. This conduct fits the definition of fraud (诈骗) under Chinese criminal law. No facts support any of the listed companion charges (related to prostitution, public order disturbances, or false accusations). Therefore, the appropriate charge is 诈骗.",
  "final_answer": "诈骗"
